#: docs/zh/tutorials/first-link.md:8
msgid "跑通首次收发"
msgstr "Run your first link"

#: docs/zh/tutorials/first-link.md:10
msgid "构建并运行"
msgstr "Build and run"

#: docs/zh/tutorials/first-link.md:12
msgid "使用 CMake 3.24 或以上、Ninja 和 C11 编译器，从仓库根目录构建双端 echo 示例。"
msgstr ""
"From the repository root, build the two-endpoint echo example with CMake 3.24 or later, Ninja and a C11 "
"compiler."

#: docs/zh/tutorials/first-link.md:21
msgid "程序应输出 `Deferred echo: PASS`。本例验证同步模拟 PHY 下的双端交付。Windows 的可执行文件带 `.exe` 后缀。"
msgstr ""
"The program should print `Deferred echo: PASS`. It exercises two endpoints over a synchronous simulated "
"PHY. The executable has an `.exe` suffix on Windows."

#: docs/zh/tutorials/first-link.md:23
msgid "存储与生命周期"
msgstr "Storage and lifetime"

#: docs/zh/tutorials/first-link.md:25
msgid "示例显式将可靠窗口与 peer 容量各设为 1，完整帧上限取构建上限与 128 字节中的较小值。为两端设置各自的本地节点、到对端的路由、PHY 和应用回调。配置及引用对象保留到销毁。"
msgstr ""
"The example sets the reliable window and peer capacity to one. Its complete frame limit is the smaller"
" of 128 bytes and the compiled ceiling. Each endpoint supplies its local node address, route to its "
"peer, PHY and application callbacks. Keep the configurations and referenced objects alive until "
"destruction."

#: docs/zh/tutorials/first-link.md:27
msgid ""
"调用 `xgl_memory_requirements()`，检查精确大小和对齐，为 `xgl_init_static()` 提供足够容量。不同 profile 和容量需要不同空间。需要按需分配时，使用 "
"`<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>` 的 `xgl_init_allocated()` 一次完成申请和初始化。"
msgstr ""
"Call `xgl_memory_requirements()` to check the exact size and alignment, then supply that storage to "
"`xgl_init_static()`. Requirements depend on the profile and capacities. When allocating storage on "
"demand, use `xgl_init_allocated()` from `<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>` to allocate and initialize in one call."

#: docs/zh/tutorials/first-link.md:29
msgid "主循环"
msgstr "Main loop"

#: docs/zh/tutorials/first-link.md:31
msgid "本例用 `<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>` 查询下次唤醒时间。"
msgstr "This example uses `<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>` to query the next wakeup."

#: docs/zh/tutorials/first-link.md:40
msgid ""
"在回调之外使用 `xgl_send_at()`。应用存储忙时，接收接纳回调可返回 BUSY。PHY TX 返回前必须完成整帧读取或复制。产品处理 `xgl_step()` 返回的接收或维护错误，详见[发送 "
"API](../guides/send.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Use `xgl_send_at()` outside callbacks. The receive acceptance callback can return BUSY while application"
" storage is occupied. PHY TX finishes reading or copying the complete frame before returning. Handle "
"`xgl_step()` receive and maintenance errors as described in the [send API](../guides/send.md)."

#: docs/zh/tutorials/first-link.md:42
msgid "可运行程序"
msgstr "Runnable programs"

#: docs/zh/tutorials/first-link.md:44
msgid "[示例](examples.md)提供生命周期完整的程序，包含可靠应用块和多跳收发。"
msgstr ""
"See [examples](examples.md) for complete programs, including reliable application chunks and multihop "
"delivery."
